<title>USA: Koger Equity Inc Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Koger Equity Inc Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands Except for Per Share Data)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				  9/30/96   9/30/95  9/30/96  9/30/95</p>
<p> Rental revenues	     $24,515  $23,762  $72,660  $71,499</p>
<p> Interest revenues		 505   13,471    1,307   14,130</p>
<p>Gain on TKPL note to</p>
<p>   Southeast			  55    5,988     (21)    5,988</p>
<p> Total revenues		 27,315   45,568   80,150   97,139</p>
<p> Net Income			2,261   18,983    7,491   23,213</p>
<p>Earnings per common share</p>
<p>and common equivalent</p>
<p>   share - primary		0.12     1.05     0.40     1.30</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>shares and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares -</p>
<p>   primary			18,961   18,157   18,741   17,916</p>
<p>Company completed a 3 million share placement with an affiliate of Apollo Real Estate Investment Fund II LP for $43.5 million. Proceeds were used to repay indebtedness.</p>
